  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Greening construction supply chains to eliminate hazardous pollutants and develop circular building practices</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to green construction supply chains to eliminate hazardous pollutants and develop circular building practices in Costa Rica. The project will disseminate good practices and innovative results through the implementation of regional pilot projects that demonstrate the feasibility of applying an approach to reduce or even eliminate chemical products of concern in construction.</narrative>
  </description>
